# Auto-publish after finishing

When a task that changes the site is complete:

1. Commit relevant changes (if the user did not forbid commits).
2. Push to `origin` (`main` on `tool2daycom-rgb/tool2day`).
3. Deploy production on Vercel: `vercel --prod --yes --scope tool2day`.
4. Briefly confirm the GitHub and live URLs.

Do this automatically at the end of each completed change set — do not wait for the user to ask again.
